            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Buno bwe bubaka Mukama bwe yawa Malaki abutuuse eri abaana ba Isirayiri.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a847e4909dcafd504b6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Kale waakiri singa omu ku bakabona aggalawo enzigi muleme okukuma omuliro ku kyoto kyange ogw’obwereere! Sibasanyukira n’akatono,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “so sikkirize kiweebwayo kyonna ekiva mu mikono gyammwe.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a847e4909dcafd504ff",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Kubanga okuva enjuba gy’eva okutuusa gy’egwa erinnya lyange kkulu mu baamawanga; obubaane buweerwayo mu buli kifo eri erinnya lyange, nga kuliko n’ekiweebwayo ekirongoofu, kubanga erinnya lyange kkulu mu baamawanga,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a857e4909dcafd5057d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Naye mmwe bakabona muvumisa erinnya lyange mu baamawanga buli lukya nga mugamba nti kya Mukama okuwaayo emmere etesaana n’ebiweebwayo ku kyoto kyange.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a857e4909dcafd505db",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Era mwogera nti, ‘Nga tulabye;’ ne mugiwunyako ne mwetamwa, era ne mwesooza,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.\n    “Bwe muleeta ekinyage, n’ekiwenyera, n’ekirwadde, ebyo bye biweebwayo bye mulina okuleeta, mbikkirize?” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a857e4909dcafd5062b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Buli mulimba yenna akolimirwe, oyo alina ennume mu kisibo kye eyeeyama okugiwaayo nga ssaddaaka eri Mukama naye n’awaayo ekintu ekiriko obulema: kubanga ndi Kabaka mukulu,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “n’erinnya lyange lya ntiisa mu baamawanga.”",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a837e4909dcafd50115",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Nabaagala,” bw’ayogera Mukama.\n    “Naye mmwe ne mumbuuza nti, ‘Watwagala otya?’ \n    “Esawu teyali muganda wa Yakobo?” bw’ayogera Mukama: “naye nze Yakobo gwe nayagala.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a837e4909dcafd5014b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Esawu namukyawa ne nfuula ensi ye ey’ensozi okuba amatongo, obusika bwe ne mbuwa ebibe eby’omu ddungu.”",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a837e4909dcafd501f2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Singa Edomu, ekika ekyava mu Esawu kigamba nti, “Wadde tukubiddwa wansi naye tulidda ne tuzimba ebyagwa.”\n    Mukama ow’Eggye ayogera nti, “Bo balizimba, naye nze ndibimenya; era abantu banaabayitanga, ensi embi, era nti abantu Mukama be yanyiigira ennaku zonna.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a837e4909dcafd5026c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Era amaaso gammwe galiraba ne mwogera nti, ‘Mukama agulumizibwe okusukka ensalo ya Isirayiri.’",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a837e4909dcafd502df",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Omwana assaamu kitaawe ekitiibwa, n’omuddu atya mukama we. Kale obanga ddala ndi kitammwe, ekitiibwa kye munzisaamu kiri ludda wa? Era obanga ndi mukama wammwe, lwaki temuntya?” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.\n    Mukama ow’Eggye bw’abagamba mmwe nti, “Mmwe bakabona munyooma erinnya lyange.\n    “Ne mubuuza nti, ‘Twayonoona tutya?’",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a847e4909dcafd50346",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Muwaayo ku kyoto kyange emmere eyonoonese.\n    “Kyokka ne mwebuuza nti, ‘Twakwonoona tutya?’ \n    “Kubanga olujjuliro lwange mulufuula ekitagasa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a847e4909dcafd503c8",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "Bwe muwaayo ensolo enzibe z’amaaso okuba ssaddaaka, muba temukoze kibi? Ate bwe muwaayo eziwenyera oba endwadde, ekyo si kibi? Kale nno mugezeeko okuzitonera omufuzi wammwe, anaabasanyukira? Ye anaafaayo okukutunulako?” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a847e4909dcafd503fd",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d41c",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.1",
        "content": "“Kale nno mbasaba mwegayirire Katonda, atukwatirwe ekisa, kubanga ebyo ffe twabyereetera. Nga muleese ebiweebwayo ebifaanana bityo, waliwo n’omu gw’ayinza okukkiriza?” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a867e4909dcafd50776",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Kale nno, mmwe bakabona, ekiragiro kino kyammwe.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50bf0",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Kale ffenna tetulina kitaffe omu? Si Katonda omu eyatutonda? Lwaki kale tetuli beesigwa eri bantu bannaffe, ne twonoona endagaano ya bakitaffe?",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50c49",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Yuda takuumye bwesigwa n’eby’omuzizo ne bikolebwa mu Isirayiri ne mu Yerusaalemi. Kubanga Yuda yayonoona ekifo kya Mukama ekitukuvu, ky’ayagala ennyo, bwe yawasa omuwala wa lubaale.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a887e4909dcafd50cb6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Buli muntu yenna akola kino, oba kabona oba muntu wa bulijjo, Mukama alimuggya mu kika kya Yakobo, newaakubadde ng’aleeta ebiweebwayo eri Mukama ow’Eggye!",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a887e4909dcafd50dab",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Ekirala kye mukola kye kino: Ekyoto kya Mukama mukijjuzza amaziga, nga mukaaba nga mukuba ebiwoobe kubanga ebiweebwayo byammwe takyabifaako.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a887e4909dcafd50e21",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Kale mubuuza nti, “Lwaki tabifaako?” Kubanga Mukama yali mujulirwa wakati wo ne mukazi wo ow’omu buvubuka bwo, naye ggwe tewali mwesigwa, ng’olimbalimba newaakubadde nga yali munno era mukazi wo gwe walagaana naye endagaano.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a887e4909dcafd50ea4",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Katonda teyabafuula omu mu mwoyo? Era lwaki yabafuula omu? Kubanga yali anoonya ezzadde eriritya Katonda. Kale mwekuume nnyo waleme kubaawo agoba mukazi we, era alimbalimba mukazi we ow’omu buvubuka bwe.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a887e4909dcafd50f2e",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Kubanga nkyawa abafumbo okwawukana,” bw’ayogera Mukama Katonda wa Isirayiri, “n’omusajja ajooga mukazi we,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.\n    Kale mwekuumenga mu mwoyo gwammwe mubeerenga beesigwa.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a897e4909dcafd50f8a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Mukama mumukooyezza n’ebigambo byammwe.\n    Naye mubuuza nti, “Tumukooyezza tutya?”\n    Kubanga mwogera nti buli akola ekibi, mulungi mu maaso ga Mukama, era abasanyukira; oba nti, “Ali ludda wa Katonda ow’obwenkanya?”",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a867e4909dcafd50822",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Bwe mutaakyuse ku mpisa zammwe n’engeri zammwe, bwe mutaafeeyo kuwa linnya lyange kitiibwa,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “kale ndibasindikira ekikolimo era emikisa gyammwe girifuuka ekikolimo. Ate ddala mmaze okubakolimira kubanga ebikulu gye ndi temubitaddeeko mwoyo.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a867e4909dcafd508a1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Kale laba, ndibonereza ezzadde lyammwe, mbasiige n’obusa mu maaso, obusa bwa ssaddaaka zammwe, era mbagobewo mu maaso gange.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a867e4909dcafd50932",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Olwo lwe mulimanya nga mbawadde ekiragiro kino, endagaano yange ne Leevi eryoke etuukirire,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a867e4909dcafd509b6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Endagaano eri mu mateeka ago yali egenderedde kuleeta bulamu na mirembe era n’embimuwa asobole okuntya, era n’antya n’ayimirira ng’atya erinnya lyange.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50a75",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Amateeka ag’amazima gali mu kamwa ke era nga tewali bulimba busangibwa mu kamwa ke. Yatambula nange mu mirembe ne mu butuukirivu era n’aggya bangi mu kibi.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50ad8",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Kubanga emimwa gy’abasumba gisaana okukuuma eby’amagezi ebya Katonda era abantu basaana okunoonya okutegeera okuva mu bo, kubanga be babaka ba Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50b18",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "Naye mwakyama ne muva mu kkubo; mwesittaza bangi olw’ebyo bye muyigiriza; mwayonoona endagaano ya Leevi,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a877e4909dcafd50b7a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d449",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.2",
        "content": "“Noolwekyo nabafuula ekinyoomebwa era ekisekererwa mu maaso g’abantu bonna olw’obutagoberera makubo gange era musala emisango nga musaliriza.”",
        "reference": "Malaki 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a897e4909dcafd5109e",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Laba, ntuma omubaka wange, alinkulembera era alirongoosa ekkubo nga sinnajja: era Mukama gwe munoonya alijja mu yeekaalu ye nga tebamanyiridde; omubaka w’endagaano gwe musanyukira, laba ajja,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd5154a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Muleete ekimu eky’ekkumi ekijjuvu mu nnyumba yange, ennyumba yange ebeeremu emmere, era mungezese,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “obanga siribaggulirawo ebituli eby’omu ggulu, ne mbawa omukisa ne gutabaako ne we guligya.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd515b2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Kale ndikuuma ennimiro zammwe ne zitazikirizibwa balabe; so n’omuzabbibu gwammwe ne gutakunkumula bibala byagwo ebitannatuuka kwengera,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd51602",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Era amawanga gonna galibayita ba mukisa: kubanga muliba nsi esanyusa, kino ky’ekisuubizo,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd51622",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Weewaawo ebigambo byammwe gye ndi bibadde bya bukambwe,” bw’ayogera Mukama.\n    “Ate nga mugamba nti, ‘Twakwogerako tutya obubi?’",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd5165d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Mwayogera nti, ‘Eby’okuweereza Katonda tebigasa, era kigasa ki okukwata ebiragiro bye era n’okutambulira mu maaso ga Mukama ow’Eggye ng’abakungubaga?",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd5169f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Okuva kaakano abeegulumiza tubayita ba mukisa; abakozi b’ebibi bakulaakulana era n’abo abasoomoza Katonda nabo bawona.’ ”",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd51707",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Abo abatya Mukama bayogeragana bokka ne bokka, Mukama n’abawulira. Ekitabo eky’okujjukira abatya Mukama ne balowooza ku linnya lye, ne kiwandiikibwa ng’alaba.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd51758",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Kale baliba bange,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “ku lunaku lwe ndibakyusizaako okuba ekintu kyange eky’omuwendo; era ndibasonyiwa ng’omuzadde bw’asonyiwa mutabani we amuweereza.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd5179b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Omulundi omulala mulyawula omutuukirivu n’omubi, oyo aweereza Katonda n’oyo atamuweereza.”",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
