            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Naye ani ayinza okugumiikiriza olunaku olw’okujja kwe, era ani aliyimirira ye bw’alirabika? Kubanga ali ng’omuliro gw’oyo alongoosa effeeza era nga sabbuuni ow’abayoza.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a897e4909dcafd51193",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Era alituula n’atunula ng’oyo alongoosa ffeeza n’agimalamu amasengere, era alirongoosa batabani ba Leevi, bakabona ba Katonda, era alibasengejja ng’ezaabu n’effeeza bwe bisengejjebwa; balyoke baweeyo ssaddaaka mu butuukirivu.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd51227",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Awo ekiweebwayo ekya Yuda ne Yerusaalemi kiryoke kisanyuse Mukama, nga mu nnaku ez’edda era nga mu myaka egyayita.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd512c5",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Era mu kiseera ekyo awatali kulonzalonza ndibasemberera nsale omusango. Ndiyanguwa okuwa obujulizi ku baloga ne ku benzi ne ku abo abalayira eby’obulimba, ne ku abo abalyazaamaanya omupakasi empeera ye; abanyigiriza nnamwandu ne mulekwa, era abajoogereza munnaggwanga, abatatya Mukama,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd51338",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Kubanga nze Mukama sijjulukuka: mmwe, batabani ba Yakobo, noolwekyo siribazikiriza.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd5137e",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Okuva mu nnaku za bajjajjammwe mwakyuka ne mukyama okuva ku biragiro byange ne mutabikwata. Mudde gye ndi, nange nadda gye muli era nnaabasonyiwa,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.\n    “Naye mwebuuza nti, ‘Tunadda tutya?’",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd51405",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "“Omuntu alinyaga Katonda?\n    “Naye mmwe munnyaga. Kyokka mugamba nti, ‘Tukunyaga tutya?’ \n    “Mu biweebwayo ne mu kimu eky’ekkumi.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8a7e4909dcafd514c1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d47d",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.3",
        "content": "Mukolimiddwa ekikolimo ekyo, kubanga mmwe, eggwanga lyonna munnyaga nze.",
        "reference": "Malaki 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8b7e4909dcafd51978",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.4.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d4c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "“Kubanga, laba, olunaku lujja, lwokya ng’ekikoomi, n’ab’amalala bonna n’abo bonna abakola ebibi baliba bisasiro: ku lunaku lwennyini balyokerwa ddala,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye, “obutabalekerawo mulandira newaakubadde ettabi.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8c7e4909dcafd519af",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.4.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d4c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "Naye mmwe abatya erinnya lyange, enjuba ey’obutuukirivu eribaviirayo ng’erina okuwonya mu biwaawaatiro byayo. Mulifuluma ne muligita ng’ennyana ez’omu kiraalo.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8c7e4909dcafd519e3",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.4.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d4c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "Era mulirinnya ku babi, kubanga baliba vvu wansi w’ebigere byammwe, ku lunaku lwe ndibalokolerako,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8c7e4909dcafd519f6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.4.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d4c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "“Mujjukire okugonderanga amateeka ga Musa omuddu wange, ebiragiro n’amateeka bye namukwasa ku Kolebu olwa Isirayiri yenna.",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a8c7e4909dcafd51a43",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "MAL.4.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "MAL",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d4c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "MAL",
            "id": "MAL.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e24c35ce9345aa3d3a3"
        },
        "chapterId": "MAL.4",
        "content": "“Laba, ndibatumira nnabbi Eriya, olunaku lwa Mukama olukulu olw’entiisa nga terunnatuuka,",
        "reference": "Malaki 4:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/MAL/MAL.4.mp3"
    },
